<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<title><%= title %></title>
	<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
	<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
	<style>
		:root{--amber:#f2a900;--dark:#241f17;--gold:#8a5a00}
		body{color:#29251f;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}
		.topbar,footer{background:var(--dark);color:#e8dfd0}
		.brand-gold{color:var(--amber)}
		.nav-link{color:#4b4438;font-weight:500}.nav-link:hover{color:var(--gold)}
		.hero{background:linear-gradient(110deg,#241f17,#68450e);color:#fff}
		.hero h1{font-weight:800}.hero-icon{font-size:clamp(8rem,22vw,15rem);color:#ffc342;line-height:1}
		.btn-amber{background:var(--amber);border-color:var(--amber);color:#241f17;font-weight:700}
		.btn-amber:hover{background:#dda000;border-color:#dda000;color:#241f17}
		.category,.product{border:1px solid #eee8dc;border-radius:1rem;transition:.2s}
		.category:hover,.product:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 .75rem 1.5rem #33240d12}
		.category-icon{width:3.5rem;height:3.5rem;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:.9rem;background:#fff2d0;color:var(--gold);font-size:1.6rem}
		.product-image{height:170px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#fff9ed;border-radius:.75rem;color:#b57a12;font-size:4.5rem}
		.price{color:var(--gold);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800}
		.promo{background:#fff3d4;border:1px solid #f1d18b}
		footer a{color:#f6c75e;text-decoration:none}
		@media(max-width:575.98px){.hero{text-align:center}.hero-icon{font-size:8rem}}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="topbar py-2 small"><div class="container d-flex justify-content-between"><span><i class="bi bi-truck me-1"></i> ส่งฟรีเมื่อช้อปครบ 1,500 บาท</span><span class="d-none d-sm-inline"><i class="bi bi-telephone me-1"></i> 02-123-4567</span></div></div>
	<header class="border-bottom">
		<nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg py-3" aria-label="เมนูหลัก"><div class="container">
			<a class="navbar-brand fw-bold fs-4" href="#home"><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill brand-gold me-2"></i>AMBER<span class="brand-gold">TECH</span></a>
			<button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav" aria-controls="mainNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="เปิดเมนู"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button>
			<div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav"><ul class="navbar-nav mx-lg-auto my-3 my-lg-0 gap-lg-2">
				<li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/">หน้าแรก</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/showProduct">สินค้าทั้งหมด</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/product">สินค้าแนะนำ</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">ติดต่อเรา</a></li>
			</ul><a href="#products" class="btn btn-outline-dark"><i class="bi bi-bag"></i><span class="ms-2">ตะกร้า</span></a></div>
		</div></nav>
	</header>
	<main>
		<%- body %>
	</main>
	<footer class="pt-5 pb-3" id="footer"><div class="container"><div class="row g-4 pb-4">
		<div class="col-md-5"><a class="text-white text-decoration-none fw-bold fs-4" href="#home"><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill brand-gold me-2"></i>AMBER<span class="brand-gold">TECH</span></a><p class="mt-3">ศูนย์รวมอุปกรณ์คอมพิวเตอร์และไอที คัดสรรสินค้าคุณภาพเพื่อทุกการใช้งาน</p></div>
		<div class="col-6 col-md-3"><h2 class="h6 text-white fw-bold">บริการลูกค้า</h2><ul class="list-unstyled lh-lg"><li><a href="#footer">วิธีการสั่งซื้อ</a></li><li><a href="#footer">การจัดส่งสินค้า</a></li><li><a href="#footer">การรับประกัน</a></li></ul></div>
		<div class="col-6 col-md-4"><h2 class="h6 text-white fw-bold">ติดต่อเรา</h2><p><i class="bi bi-telephone me-2 brand-gold"></i>02-123-4567</p><p><i class="bi bi-envelope me-2 brand-gold"></i>hello@ambertech.example</p><a class="me-3" href="#footer" aria-label="Facebook"><i class="bi bi-facebook fs-5"></i></a><a href="#footer" aria-label="Instagram"><i class="bi bi-instagram fs-5"></i></a></div>
	</div><div class="border-top border-secondary pt-3 text-center small">© 2025 Amber Tech. สงวนลิขสิทธิ์</div></div></footer>
	<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
